title Cassette on the sound server, idle (T6e): the strip leads with the card label and (server); the narrow box says (server) with the time left
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_DEMO_SERVER 1
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
shot server-idle
@480x320,640x480 expect text "USB AUDIO CODEC (server) · TAKE 006 · 12 h 40 left"
@320x480 expect text "(server) 12 h 40"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect text "SOFT"
expect noquit
